{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "category-return-rate",
  "title": "Highest return rate by category",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "c5962166-116f-42c7-b1fc-46f0a2497d84",
      "question": "Which product category had the highest return rate in Q3 2026, measured as the value of items returned in the quarter divided by net sales in the quarter?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T05:34:06.028966Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T05:34:13.537459Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Electronics** had the highest return rate in Q3 2026 at **16.72%** (returned value $7,981.06 ÷ net sales $47,732.90) [1].\n\nFull ranking for the quarter (July 1 – September 30, 2026):\n\n| Category | Net sales (USD) | Returned value (USD) | Return rate |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Electronics | 47,732.90 | 7,981.06 | 16.72% |\n| Apparel | 11,362.97 | 1,645.73 | 14.48% |\n| Bedding & Bath | 19,844.17 | 1,746.24 | 8.80% |\n| Home Decor | 25,226.68 | 1,983.87 | 7.86% |\n| Outdoor & Garden | 27,048.33 | 2,007.84 | 7.42% |\n| Furniture | 42,181.19 | 2,887.08 | 6.84% |\n| Kitchen & Dining | 33,670.35 | 1,757.77 | 5.22% |\n\nReturn rate = value of items returned in the quarter ÷ net sales in the quarter.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — retail_sales — evidence `hermes-receipt:6a53b40a3e5942ba6a62adc22a3c4b3a6e587cd565d2c2f2f4deaa993a5ee130`",
        "citations": [
          {
